  "details": "Subgraphs feels incomplete. Curently you can only use it more like as macro or shorthands for certain \"static\" commands. It's hard to pass arguments directly, you need to define variables and use it to pass any information into subgraph code. It's inconvenient and counter-intuitive. I belive there is should be a way to define custom node type with data parameters. If it were possible to create \"pure\" functions, the community could easily and quickly create libraries for Udon programs, which can greatly simplify and speed up the process of developing scripts.",
